{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af1482e","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"923KGEUG9ofBm7dYkkrxz","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Mean\n\nThe mean is the arithmetic average of a set of values, calculated by summing all values and dividing by the count. It is the most commonly used measure of central tendency but is sensitive to outliers. When data is skewed, the median is often a better representation of the typical value.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Measures of Central Tendency","url":"https://statistics.laerd.com/statistical-guides/measures-central-tendency-mean-mode-median.php","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a36"},{"type":"article","title":"Central Tendency | Understanding the Mean, Median & Mode","url":"https://www.scribbr.co.uk/stats/measures-of-central-tendency/","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a37"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/923KGEUG9ofBm7dYkkrxz.md"}